 merge node inside the loop, plus wiring:\n[ASSISTANT] Now let's add the decision node and merge node using flow_edit.py (user-owned), then wire everything together.\n[ASSISTANT] decidePriority1 and joinBranches1 need `parentId: \"loop1\"` set (they're inside the loop) \u2014 flow_edit.py's add-node doesn't have a --parent flag, so I'll add it directly.\n[ASSISTANT] All wired. Now configure the connector nodes via `node configure` with resolved values from seed.json.", "model_used": "claude-sonnet-5", "assistant_turn_count": 93, "messages": [{"role": "assistant", "started_at": "2026-08-19T15:51:19.198875", "completed_at": "2026-08-19T15:51:24.462894", "generation_duration_ms": 5264.038683002582, "content_blocks": [{"block_type": "thinking", "sequence": 0, "text": null, "thinking": null, "signature": "", "tool_use_id": null, "is_error": false}], "tool_use_ids": [], "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_tokens": 3637, "cache_read_tokens": 39956, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "stop_reason": null, "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "message_id": "msg_bdrk_ynwfbvcbekukofgyu53ub3fl4mhh363rvfxel766364y46cjm77q", "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"role": "assistant", "started_at": "2026-08-19T15:51:24.462894", "completed_at": "2026-08-19T15:51:25.185463", "generation_duration_ms": 722.5699179980438, "content_blocks": [{"block_type": "tool_use", "sequence": 0, "text": null, "thinking": null, "signature": null, "tool_use_id": "toolu_bdrk_0139faE1QbeBK6s3FPK9bpQf", "is_error": false}], "tool_use_ids": ["toolu_bdrk_0139faE1QbeBK6s3FPK9bpQf"], "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 216, "cache_creation_tokens": 0, "cache_read_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "stop_reason": null, "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "message_id": "msg_bdrk_ynwfbvcbekukofgyu53ub3fl4mhh363rvfxel766364y46cjm77q", "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"role": "assistant", "started_at": "2026-08-19T15:51:25.282424", "completed_at": "2026-08-19T15:51:27.388311", "generation_duration_ms": 2105.886778997956, "content_block